@page
@model DevOpsReviewA6.Pages.MarketOpModel
@{
}


<div class="pageSize">

    <h1>Market Opportunity</h1>

    <div class="columnsContainer">

        @* Population Information *@
        <div class="colStructure">
            <div class="row">
                <div class="col-sm-6">
                    @* Paragraph explaining growth of OSU and potential for profit *@
                    <div class="cPara">
                        <div>Each year, Oklahoma State University brings in an average of 1,825 additional students.</div>
                        <div>As of 2026, there were 30,671 total students enrolled in OSU.</div>
                        <div>These students come from all 50 states and 100+ other countries.</div>
                        <br />
                        <div>The longer a Culver's is maintained in Stillwater, the more students you can bring in.</div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="col-sm-6">
                    @* Image of the Student Library*@
                    <img src="~/photos/osu student union.jpg" class="picRes" alt="Image of the inside of the Student Union." />
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        @* OSU Sports Sponsorship Opportunities *@
        <div class="colStructure">
            <div class="row">
                <div class="col-sm-4">
                    <p class="cPara">
                        @* Image here *@
                        <img src="~/photos/osu pistol pete.png" class="picRes" alt="Image of Oklahoma State University mascot Pistol Pete." />
                    </p>
                </div>
                <div class="col-sm-8">
                    <div class="cPara">
                        <div>Go Pokes!</div>
                        <br />
                        <div>Oklahoma State University hosts "Game Days" for days that sports events are scheduled to occur within Stillwater.</div>
                        <div>These often bring in even more traffic into Stillwater, providing a prime opportunity for more people to eat at a local Culvers' restaraunt.</div>
                        <div>(Some loyal customers may even come into Stillwater for these game days!)</div>
                        <br />
                        <div>Sponsoring during these games will also raise awareness of a local Culvers' being present.</div>
                        <div>Major beverage companies like Pepsi and Mountain Dew often sponsor these events, so why not Culvers'?</div>
                        <div>OSU has a process for sponsoring games at <a href="https://www.okstatealumni.org/s/860/18/interior.aspx?sid=860&gid=1&pgid=15560">https://www.okstatealumni.org/</a>.</div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    
    </div>

</br>
    
